    "_help": "Weight: seconds after a swing before the next one can start (you can still move, roll or block). light = ordinary chain steps, finisher = the chain's finisher steps, power = power (heavy) attacks. twoHandedMul / daggerMul / rangedMul scale it for those weapons. Faster attack speed shortens it. A step can set its own \"recover\". recLight / recHeavy: follow-through animations for one- and two-handed weapons.",
    "light": 0.05, "finisher": 0.32, "power": 0.5,
    "twoHandedMul": 1.6, "daggerMul": 0.5, "rangedMul": 0.6,
    "recLight": "recA", "recHeavy": "recHook"
  },
